          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Preventive&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Maintenance</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This plan provides a dedicated, on-site Stryker ProCare medical device technician who works with you to enable maximum performance and workflow management solutions related to equipment use, staff engagement and patient safety.&nbsp;</span><br>\n</p>\n",
