          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">ProCare&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Protect</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This plan is a maintenance and service solution that provides OEM support with unlimited service calls, enabling you to balance equipment uptime needs within your budget.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
